est are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, and INC-0001 was already there, so I did not create a duplicate. It describes the failure, both rollback attempts, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging) and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. Don't redeploy a v2.3.1 build until both are understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}